{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55562","headline":"浮石寺 · 钱鏐","name":"浮石寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灧灧霞光映碧流，潭湾深处有龙湫。\n危楼百尺临江渚，石在波心千古浮。\n（见同治十一年刊区作霖纂《余干县志》卷十八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱鏐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55562.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55562","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}